    },
    {
      "text": "Precipitation flux (kg m-2 s-1) is converted to daily millimetres by multiplying by 86,400, then summed annually.",
      "source_module": "M1"
    },
    {
      "text": "Temperature is converted from Kelvin to degrees Celsius.",
      "source_module": "M1"
    },
